si-berjiwa-qurani","type":"article","title":"Diklat Anggota UKM Seni Religi 2026 Jadi Langkah Awal Membangun Generasi Berjiwa Qur'ani","description":"Sebanyak 68 peserta mengikuti Diklat Anggota UKM Seni Religi UB di Malang dan Kota Batu. Mereka mengenal delapan bidang melalui Muhadhoroh dan berdiskusi langsung dengan pengurus sebelum pengukuhan anggota.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/yzaa35ug/production/820b3f6ed2dafaf564415355036280d140a4f502-4032x3024.jpg","category":"Liputan","date":"24 November 2026","time":"","location":"","tags":[],"body":[],"agenda":[],"gallery":[]},{"_id":"berita-mtq-ub-xix-2026","slug":"mtq-ub-xix-2026-403-peserta-fakultas-teknik-juara-umum","type":"article","title":"MTQ UB XIX 2026 Diikuti 403 Peserta, Fakultas Teknik Raih Juara Umum","description":"Musabaqah Tilawatil Qur’an Universitas Brawijaya XIX berlangsung pada 4–7 Mei 2026 dengan 403 peserta dari berbagai fakultas. Fakultas Teknik kembali meraih gelar juara umum.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/yzaa35ug/production/d57b910df52d7304093e300f70d3862cd32f2dbc-3008x1688.jpg","category":"Liputan","date":"16 November 2026","time":"","location":"","tags":[],"body":[],"agenda":[],"gallery":[]}]},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1795688839447,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchFailureReason":null,"fetchMeta":null,"isInvalidated":false,"status":"success","fetchStatus":"idle"},"queryKey":["aktivitas","meta"],"queryHash":"[\"aktivitas\",\"meta\"]"},{"dehydratedAt":1795688839561,"state":{"data":{"total":3,"page":1,"pages":1,"items":[{"_id":"berita-gbqn-xi-2026","slug":"gbqn-xi-2026-tilawah-karya-ilmiah-1269-peserta-di-malang","type":"article","title":"Dari Tilawah hingga Karya Ilmiah, GBQN XI Pertemukan 1.269 Peserta di Malang","description":"Malang, sebanyak 1.269 peserta dari 12 provinsi mengikuti Gebyar Brawijaya Qur’ani Nasional (GBQN) XI di Universitas Brawijaya (UB) pada 24–27 September 2026. Ajang dua tahunan Unit Kegia